      "3434"
    ]
  },
  {
    "statement": "Creating pit habitats between 1 and 50 mm, along with holes, grooves and environmentally-sensitive material, had mixed effects on invertebrate abundances depending on the species group.",
    "citations": [
      "3455"
    ]
  },
  {
    "statement": "Creating groove habitats between 1 and 50 mm had mixed effects on invertebrate abundances.",
    "citations": [
      "3448"
    ]
  },
  {
